WEBVTT

00:06:59.626 --> 00:07:03.577
by the time Riitta is stuffing
cold, wet bull kelp up your nose.

00:07:03.601 --> 00:07:06.604
(Laughter)

00:07:07.063 --> 00:07:10.253
Working with an analog camera
means the process can be slow

00:07:10.277 --> 00:07:11.785
and physically challenging.

00:07:12.086 --> 00:07:13.696
The person in front of the camera

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:17.117
might be kneeling for three hours
in a freezing sleet,

00:07:17.141 --> 00:07:19.177
be bombarded by mosquitoes

00:07:19.201 --> 00:07:21.025
or actually, they can also be allergic

00:07:21.049 --> 00:07:23.247
to the local flora
they've just been coated in.

00:07:23.271 --> 00:07:24.715
RI: And many other things.

00:07:24.739 --> 00:07:26.522
(Laughter)

00:07:26.546 --> 00:07:29.291
And then, there's,
of course, the elements.

00:07:29.315 --> 00:07:33.006
Unpredictability
is one of the main drivers